        "cos 2x / 2 + C"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "solution": "第一类换元（凑微分）：∫ sin 2x dx = (1/2) ∫ sin 2x d(2x) = -cos 2x / 2 + C。核心技巧：令 u = 2x，du = 2dx → dx = du/2。"
    },
    {
